y5-compositor for Debian / Ubuntu
=================================

Tracks and packaging overview: see document/DISTRIBUTION.md in the source tree.

Installation (PPA)
------------------

  sudo add-apt-repository ppa:kacperpaczos/nourish
  sudo apt update

Core session only:

  sudo apt install y5-compositor y5-compositor-settings

Former full bundle (compositor + settings + monitor + polkit + xwayland + mx):

  sudo apt install y5-compositor-full

First-time configuration
------------------------

None required: on first session start the wrapper seeds a complete default
~/.config/y5.compositor/settings.json (the same canonical template the
settings tool and the Track A installer use). To customize it:

  y5.compositor.settings

An existing settings.json is never overwritten by the wrapper.

Starting a session
------------------

Log out and pick **Y5 Compositor** from your display manager.

Optional packages
-----------------

  sudo apt install y5-polkit-agent y5-xwayland-satellite
  sudo apt install y5-compositor-monitor
  sudo apt install y5-mx-gesture-daemon

  systemctl --user enable --now mx-gesture-daemon.service

  mkdir -p ~/.config/mx-gesture-daemon
  cp /usr/share/y5-compositor/mx-gesture-daemon/config.example.toml \
     ~/.config/mx-gesture-daemon/config.toml

Building from source
--------------------

See debian/README.source.
